{
    "note": "dsh 端到端演示剧本：让 dsh 连续跑三轮 bash 工具循环（真实执行 ls / echo / pwd），最后打印收尾文本自行退出。**注意第 2 条是给「会话标题生成」请求准备的**：dsh 0.1.5-rc.2 在首条主请求之后会额外发一条标题请求（同 provider、messages=2），它在脚本里同样要占一条——实测的到达顺序是 主请求 → 标题请求 → 主请求 ……，所以第 2 条写成一句纯文本当标题，工具轮次从第 3 条继续。配 --exhausted hold 用：即使意料之外地多来一次请求，拿到的也是同一条收尾文本。压测请用长剧本（data/scenarios/long-run-dsh.json，由 scripts/perf/gen-long-run.ts 的 --tool bash --args command+description 生成）+ --exhausted stop。工具名与形状按实测：bash 小写，参数 {command, description} 两个都必填。",
    "defaults": {
        "delayMs": 10,
        "chunkDelayMs": 1,
        "chunkSize": 4
    },
    "responses": [
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "先看一眼当前目录里有什么。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_dsh_ls",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": {
                                "command": "ls",
                                "description": "List files in current directory"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "llm-mock 演示"
            },
            "finish_reason": "stop"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "再打印一行标记，确认工具链路是通的。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_dsh_echo",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": {
                                "command": "echo llm-mock-perf-tick",
                                "description": "Print a marker line"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "接下来确认工作目录的绝对路径。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_dsh_pwd",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "bash",
                            "arguments": {
                                "command": "pwd",
                                "description": "Show the working directory path"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "三轮工具调用都回来了：目录列表、标记回显与工作目录路径都正常，llm-mock 的 Chat Completions 链路验证结束。"
            },
            "finish_reason": "stop"
        }
    ]
}
